Housed completely inside a streamlined, removable chest Arc Reactor housing, millions of microscopic nanobots instantly spread across Tony's body on command, completely eliminating the need for external gantries, suitcase assemblies, or mechanical pods. Because the armor is composed of malleable nanobots, it can fluidly reconfigure its shape mid-combat to generate virtually any tool or weapon instantly—including heavy energy cannons, battering rams, foot clamps, flight wings, protective shields, and surgical wound sprayers. Highly durable yet repairable mid-fight by drawing nanobots from other areas of the body, the Mark 50 proved resilient enough to let Tony go toe-to-toe with Thanos on Titan and survive a direct blast from the Power Stone.
